===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈɧɪlˌja/|lang=sv}}
* {{audio|Sv-skilja.ogg|audio|lang=sv}}

===Verb===
{{sv-verb-irr|skiljer|[[skilde]] ''or'' [[skiljde]]|[[skilt]] ''or'' [[skiljt]]|[[skilj]]}}

# to [[separate]]; to cause to be separate
# to separate; to divide into separate parts
# to [[tell apart]]; to [[discern]], to [[differentiate]]
